howItsMade:
Token Buddy harnesses the power of cutting-edge technologies:
@next/font: Optimizes font loading.
@rainbow-me/rainbowkit: Provides a comprehensive suite of tools for wallet connection.
@web3uikit/core & @web3uikit/icons: Offers a wide range of UI components and icons for building web3 interfaces.
@web3uikit/web3: Integrates essential web3 functionalities.
Autoprefixer & Postcss: Ensures cross-browser compatibility of our CSS.
Connectkit: Simplifies wallet connections.
Next.js: Facilitates server-side rendering and static website generation.
React & React-Dom: Powers our user interfaces with dynamic and interactive elements.
Viem: Aids in creating visually appealing designs.
Wagmi: Provides hooks and utilities for web3 integration.
